  – "path": lets us keep only *.java source files  
  – "repo_name": later grouping / reporting by repository if desired  
  – "ref": branch / tag indicator (usually keep “refs/heads/master”)  

• GITHUB_REPOS.GITHUB_REPOS.SAMPLE_CONTENTS  
