--Description:
-- Goal: list the 10 most frequently imported Java package names.
-- Reasoning steps (embedded as comments):
--   1) Filter SAMPLE_FILES for rows whose "path" ends in ".java".
--   2) Join to SAMPLE_CONTENTS via "id" to access the file text.
--   3) SPLIT each file’s content on newline and FLATTEN so each row is one line.
--   4) Keep only lines that start with the keyword `import` (case‑insensitive) and
--      exclude lines that contain `import static` because those point to classes,
--      not packages.
--   5) From each remaining line extract the *package* portion (everything before the
