Begin Exploring Related Columns
Relevant columns & their potential usage  
• GITHUB_REPOS.GITHUB_REPOS.SAMPLE_FILES  
  – "id": join‑key that matches "id" in SAMPLE_CONTENTS  
  – "path": lets us keep only *.java source files  
  – "repo_name": later grouping / reporting by repository if desired  
  – "ref": branch / tag indicator (usually keep “refs/heads/master”)  

• GITHUB_REPOS.GITHUB_REPOS.SAMPLE_CONTENTS  
  – "id": join‑key back to SAMPLE_FILES  
  – "content": full textual content we can split into lines and scan for “import ”  
  – "sample_path": duplicate of path (occasionally handy)  

Only those two tables are necessary for discovering Java import statements.



